        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Natural sources include lightning, volcanoes, biological decay, forest fires, soil microorganisms, oceans, etc. NO is produced when N₂ and O₂ in the air react during lightning. It is produced by microorganism using air N₂."
          }
